  "translation": "Ndipo Davide anati kwa Elohim: “Kodi sindine ndimene ndinalamula kuyesa anthu? Ine ndimenenso ndinachimwa, inendiro ndinachita zoipa; koma nkhosa izi zachita chiyani? Yahwe, Mulungu wanga, khululukirani, dziko la manja lili pa ine, ndi pa nyumba ya atate wanga, koma osati pa anthu anu, kuti asatenge chilango.”",
